        "thought_text": "Simulate the Technogoblet's selection process by sorting all students in each school by power in descending order. Identify the winner of each original school. Then, iterate through the list of Chosen Ones; if a Chosen One is not the identified winner of their school, they require a new school. This approach verifies the outcome by explicitly modeling the selection criteria rather than just comparing values.",
